From b24922d6b186a923b9196efbec949d993dd6488a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: qwen38-4090 <noreply@localhost>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 12:20:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 35/49] research27/28: overlapped GDN record block and
 attention (NINFER_GDN_OVERLAP=1|2, NINFER_ATTN_OVERLAP=1)

Default off. Bit-identical to the serial route (482/482 ids), but 0.4-0.7% slower per round: the overlapped
kernels share DRAM (union-busy time unchanged) and each fork/join adds an idle gap. Kept for the record.
